==== Flashing ANY Firmware ====

  - You must set your TCP/IP v4 protocol to:
    * IP: 192.168.1.2
    * Netmask: 255.255.255.0
    * Gateway: 192.168.1.1
    * DNS: (optional, can be blank).
  - Power off the router.
  - Press reset button near the antenna.
  - Keep it pressed while powering up during ~20+ seconds.
  - Browse to ''%%http://192.168.1.1%%'', you should see this screen:\\ {{:media:doc:cfe63xx_web-upgrade.png?500|}} 
  - Upload binary file and update software.
  - Wait until router reboots.
  - ssh to 192.168.1.1 and set a root password, or browse to ''%%http://192.168.1.1%%'' if LuCI is installed.

